            </rdf:Bag>
         </dc:subject>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">On 20 October 2022, we ran a workshop with academic researchers and government agents who had contributed to the COVID-19 response in Australia on â€œThe role of surveillance in epidemic responseâ€. Following the workshop, we developed five recommendations to strengthen respiratory virus surveillance systems in Australia, which we present in in this article.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
